  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "一夜爆红的散文诗主持  (Overnight Viral Hosting Sensation)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "crew": "场务",
    "wen_simo": "闻思默"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a lively fan book club, the event host introduces Wen Simo, whose improvised rainstorm commentary on Twelve Singers has made him an overnight internet celebrity. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天我们特别有幸邀请到闻思默老师来到现场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "请闻老师跟我们进行交流，欢迎大家！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "闻老师在十二歌王暴雨直播中的主持太精彩了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在在网上被誉为电视史上第一即兴散文诗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "过奖过奖，没那么夸张的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "而且闻老师在直播平台上的粉丝关注量也超百万了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "真是一夜之间就变成网红了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "是啊，现在网上还有人这样问呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "说在做视频主播的人里面，我的岁数是最大的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我又没整过容，怎么就成了网红了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "大家喜欢的是闻老师真实的才华。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "谢谢大家今天来参加读书会。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天我们特别有幸邀请到闻思默老师来到现场。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today we are deeply honored to invite Mr Wen Simo here in person.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "请闻老师跟我们进行交流，欢迎大家！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us have Mr Wen share his thoughts with us, and welcome everyone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "闻老师在十二歌王暴雨直播中的主持太精彩了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Wen hosted brilliantly during the Twelve Singers rainstorm broadcast.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "现在在网上被誉为电视史上第一即兴散文诗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Online it is now hailed as the greatest improvised prose poem in television history.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "过奖过奖，没那么夸张的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You flatter me, it is really not that dramatic.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "而且闻老师在直播平台上的粉丝关注量也超百万了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Moreover, Mr Wen now has over a million followers on streaming platforms.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "真是一夜之间就变成网红了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He truly turned into an internet celebrity overnight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "是啊，现在网上还有人这样问呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Indeed, people online are even asking a funny question now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "说在做视频主播的人里面，我的岁数是最大的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They say that among video streamers, I am the oldest of the lot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我又没整过容，怎么就成了网红了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have never had cosmetic surgery either, so how did I become an internet star?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "大家喜欢的是闻老师真实的才华。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What everyone loves is Mr Wen and his genuine talent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "谢谢大家今天来参加读书会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all for coming to the book club today.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
